  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.8.62\n\nReleased on 2026-09-22.\n\nStudio no longer drops an edit's preview while its tab is in the background, and the catalog gains a text match cut.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Studio:** Don't fail a shadow reload while the tab is hidden ([16959deea](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/16959deeac55c65a730d18b3a4ef7c366b0e0223), [#4292](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/4292)).\n\n## Catalog\n\n- **Registry:** Text-match-cut ([0945de83c](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/0945de83c7f51ba0c20c7c0a56421f066a378ee8), [#4288](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/4288)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.8.61...v0.8.62\n"
